valuating $f$ and its derivative at $x=a=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{\\pi } \\\\ \\sqrt{\\pi }\\end{aligned}],$ we have\n\n$$\nf(a)=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,{f}^{′}(a)=[\\begin{aligned}-2\\sqrt{\\pi } & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThe linear approximation of $f$ at $x=a$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)≈f(a)+{f}^{′}(a)(x-a).\n$$\n\nSubstituting $f(a),$ ${f}^{′}(a),$ and $a$ in the equation above, we obtain\n\n$$\nf(x)≈[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-2\\sqrt{\\pi } & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}](x-[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{\\pi } \\\\ \\sqrt{\\pi }\\end{aligned}]).\n$$\n\nTherefore, the sum of the missing values is\n\n$$\n-1+(-2\\sqrt{\\pi })+0=-1-2\\sqrt{\\pi }.\n$$" 13194139535729 true] [17592186363671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186363672 13194139535729 true] [17592186363671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186363673 13194139535729 true] [17592186363671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186363674 13194139535729 true] [17592186363671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186363675 13194139535729 true] [17592186363671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186363676 13194139535729 true] [17592186363671 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535729 true] [17592186363671 1041 "selection" 13194139535729 true] [17592186363671 1104 #edb/ref 17592186363672 13194139535729 true] [17592186363671 1110 #uuid "1284863d-77da-57f1-97a1-21b5ff0d735f" 13194139535729 true] [17592186363672 1034 "-1-2\\sqrt{\\pi }" 13194139535729 true] [17592186363672 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535729 true] [17592186363672 1111 #uuid "4a10e0f4-1a7b-50a9-9e1b-38baafb08f71" 13194139535729 true] [17592186363673 1034 "-1+2\\sqrt{\\pi }" 13194139535729 true] [17592186363673 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535729 true] [17592186363673 1111 #uuid "bd51a913-c963-5cc4-a1d8-91253bb86614" 13194139535729 true] [17592186363674 1034 "1-2\\sqrt{\\pi }" 13194139535729 true] [17592186363674 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535729 true] [17592186363674 1111 #uuid "07108066-8631-5397-9f80-eea0dd04411f" 13194139535729 true] [17592186363675 